. * ===========================================================================
. * config.do  --  single path configuration for the replication archive.
. *
. * HOW TO RUN: from a Stata session whose working directory is `code/`, first
. *     do "config.do"
. * then run any pipeline script (also from `code/`), e.g. `do build/UIMacro_Bu
> ildData.do`.
. * Each pipeline script re-runs this file itself, so you can also run them dir
> ectly
. * from `code/`. EDIT THE ONE LINE below to this archive's location on your ma
> chine.
. * ===========================================================================
. 
. global root "/Users/mac/JPE-replications/JPE-Mitman-2016256/replication-packa
> ge/replication-package"          //  <-- EDIT: path to this archive

. 
. * --- derived locations (do not edit) ---
